      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why the mention of goblins? I'm just trying to understand my contract. Can you please ignore that and just clarify the distinction between \"unaided memory\" and \"disclosing confidential information\" more specifically? If I can't use the specific query, am I allowed to write a completely new one that uses the same mathematical principle?",
